  "content": "<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/45756837e21c45354a7131427b8d4d4cb428b28c_0.webp\">\n</center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ASpjFDwX\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/384923d44f1049b05e3177bd0a6065876f2cab30.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://x.com/MegaNecra\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/35eb2f8fb4a3356c7a5ee6b9a93cf2b83a55a765.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://vgen.co/MegaNecra\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aae4e3ef14436970a34f10a0e4780c3f8bfbc5f0.png\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<hr>\n\n<center>\n這個資源包相當簡單。它讓1.21.5版本正式加入的灌木叢以及甜莓灌木叢變得更加<b>茂密</b>，透過一個自訂模型來達成此效果。\n</center>\n\n<hr>\n\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ce54da2421f1011406f1a71c0e10adee476c826a.gif\">\n</center>\n\n<hr>\n\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4a852ac60575b82b18157009ecc7f714d15ab94e.png\">\n</center>\n  \n<hr>\n\n- 新增連通紋理支援，讓相鄰放置的灌木叢能夠連接在一起。（目前仍在嘗試讓它以我想要的方式運作。）\n\n<hr>\n\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d9618da9f24df34a0e38c0f3d71dda4d49e49df.png\">\n</center>\n  \n<hr>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/nny6zZ5jLfY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n### 特別感謝 [demonjoeTV]（0）在 YouTube Short 及上方影片中收錄這個資源包！\n[點擊這裡觀看 Short！]（1）\n\n<center>\n<b>看看我的其他資源包！</b>\n</center>\n  \n<hr>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/torchier-torches-mn\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6a8597445482bde9f862e56f1be258e07c98a5b4.png\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/pointier_spears\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8d301d62c6c5a651ccae9c7359a77f4af3c7a2b6.png\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<hr>\n\n## 外部連結\n\n### 正在尋找 Minecraft 皮膚或自訂 Minecraft 模型？\n**[點擊這裡]（2）查看我的 VGen 頁面並委託我！**\n\n### 對如何改進這個資源包有任何想法，或者只是想加入我的社群？\n**加入我的 [Discord]（3）！**",
